        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>
              Be prepared to answer the following questions:
              <ol marker="i.">
                <li>
                  <p>
                    What is the relationship between the length of the Prüfer code of a tree and the number of vertices of the tree?
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <p>
